  "pub_rows_err_size": "Carpet {0}: enter the width and the length.",
  "pub_rows_err_range": "Carpet {0}: the width and the length must be from 0.01 to 20 m.",
  "pub_rows_err_qty": "Carpet {0}: the quantity must be a whole number, at least 1.",
  "pub_rows_err_total": "At most 50 carpets per order; there are {0} now.",
  "pub_rows_not_carried": "Carpets that could not be carried over from the calculator: {0}. Please enter them again.",
  "pub_ex_express_w": "Subject to free drying capacity.",
  "pub_proc_eyebrow": "Process",
  "pub_proc_title": "Six steps, each one recorded",
  "pub_proc_text": "At pickup every carpet gets a tag and a condition report with photos — before it touches water. So we always know whose carpet it is, where it is and what state it arrived in.",
  "pub_step1": "Intake and report",
  "pub_step1_t": "We measure the real area, identify the fibre and check for urine traces with a UV lamp. Everything we find is written down and photographed.",
  "pub_step2": "Dust removal",
  "pub_step2_t": "Dry dirt comes out before the carpet sees water. The step most skip — and the one that makes the biggest difference.",
  "pub_step3": "Washing",
  "pub_step3_t": "Fibre-matched shampoo, brushing with the pile, rinsing until the water runs clear. Wool and fringes are done cold and by hand.",
  "pub_step4": "Spin extraction",
  "pub_step4_t": "Removes most of the water mechanically. Without it drying takes days and carpets come back damp.",
  "pub_step4_n": "Why the {0}-hour turnaround holds",
  "pub_step5": "Drying",
  "pub_step5_t": "In summer on a 200 m² outdoor drying rack, in winter and rain indoors on 100 m² with a dehumidifier.",
  "pub_step5_n": "Same turnaround in January as in May",
  "pub_step6": "Finishing",
  "pub_step6_t": "Pile grooming, vacuuming, moisture check and wrapping. A carpet doesn't leave until the meter says it's dry.",
  "pub_step6_n": "A damp carpet in plastic wrap becomes mould",
  "pub_price_eyebrow": "Prices",
  "pub_price_title": "The price depends on the fibre, not your address",
  "pub_price_text": "Per square metre of the actual measured area. Prices exclude VAT.",
  "pub_price_tab_carpets": "Carpets",
  "pub_price_tab_extras": "Extras and zones",
  "pub_price_h_class": "Class",
  "pub_price_h_what": "Includes",
  "pub_price_h_min": "Min.",
  "pub_price_h_item": "Item",
  "pub_price_h_when": "When",
  "pub_price_h_price": "Price",
  "pub_price_free": "free",
  "pub_price_foot": "Business clients with a contract: 5–15% discount depending on monthly area. Extras are not discounted.",
  "pub_per_m": "€/running m",
  "pub_prom_eyebrow": "What you get with every wash",
  "pub_prom_title": "The standard doesn't change from carpet to carpet.",
  "pub_prom_text": "Same process, same products and same report — whether it's one hallway runner or twenty carpets from a kindergarten.",
  "pub_prom_1": "A tag on every carpet",
  "pub_prom_1t": "Follow each carpet's progress in the client portal.",
  "pub_prom_2": "Photo condition report",
  "pub_prom_2t": "Before washing — no misunderstandings afterwards.",
  "pub_prom_3": "A time slot you choose",
  "pub_prom_3t": "Pick the day and the hour. Open {0}.",
  "pub_prom_4": "Price up front",
  "pub_prom_4t": "In writing, before we start.",
  "pub_prom_5": "Dry carpet, meter-checked",
  "pub_prom_5t": "Never damp in plastic wrap.",
  "pub_prom_6": "Free rewash",
  "pub_prom_6t": "If something isn't right, tell us within 7 days.",
  "pub_svc_eyebrow": "Not just carpets",
  "pub_svc_title": "One call. Everything clean.",
  "pub_svc_text": "We have done field maintenance for thirty years. Carpets are what we digitised first; everything else we have done just as long. For services without a listed price, we agree the price per site: call us and we come to see it.",
  "pub_svc_all": "Services and prices",
  "pub_how_eyebrow": "How to book",
  "pub_how_title": "Four steps, no guesswork",
  "pub_how_1": "Calculate the price",
  "pub_how_1t": "Enter the size and carpet type. You see the amount right away.",
  "pub_how_2": "Pick a time",
  "pub_how_2t": "Choose a day and a window, and we'll e-mail you an offer with the exact arrival time.",
  "pub_how_3": "We pick it up",
  "pub_how_3t": "At your address, with a tag and a photo report.",
  "pub_how_4": "We return it, you pay",
  "pub_how_4t": "You pay only after the carpet is cleaned and returned.",
  "pub_area_eyebrow": "Service area",
  "pub_area_title": "Dugo Selo, east Zagreb and surroundings",
  "pub_area_text": "The pickup and delivery price depends on the zone. Each zone lists its price and pickup time.",
  "pub_area_base": "Plant and drying room",
  "pub_g_eyebrow": "Guarantee and liability",
  "pub_g_title": "What we promise, and what we can't",
  "pub_g_1": "Free rewash",
  "pub_g_1t": "If the result isn't what we agreed, we wash it again at our cost. Tell us within 7 days.",
  "pub_g_2": "Report before washing",
  "pub_g_2t": "Existing stains, damage and weak colourfastness are photographed and recorded at pickup. You sign it.",
  "pub_g_3": "We're insured",
  "pub_g_3t": "Liability insurance and cover for customers' goods in our care — from pickup to delivery.",
  "pub_g_4": "A photo of every job",
  "pub_g_4t": "A documented standard and a photo for every completed task — not just carpets.",
  "pub_faq_1": "Care labels and liability",
  "pub_faq_1a": "<p>We clean your carpets following the instructions on their care label. We accept no liability if the material does not respond to the care instructions due to poor material quality, or if methods used during the customer's own use and care have caused damage or defects.</p><p><strong>Carpets without a care label stating the cleaning method are cleaned solely and exclusively at the customer's own risk.</strong></p><p>We do not guarantee removal of stains older than six months, bleach marks, burns, sun fading or moth damage.</p>",
  "pub_faq_2": "How to make a complaint",
  "pub_faq_2a": "<p>You can hand in a written complaint in person at our premises, or send it by post or email. How to complain is clearly displayed on our premises and printed on the invoice.</p><p>We reply to every written complaint in writing within 15 days of receipt. We keep a record of complaints for one year.</p>",
  "pub_faq_3": "Turnaround, payment and collection",
  "pub_faq_3a": "<p>The standard turnaround is {0} hours from pickup; express is {1} hours for a surcharge, subject to free drying capacity. You choose the day and the hour within our opening hours ({2}), and we call you an hour before we come.</p><p>Payment is due on delivery — cash, card or bank transfer. Business clients receive an invoice with deferred payment.</p><p>When your carpet is ready we let you know the same day, then remind you on day 7 and day 21. We are not responsible for items not collected within 30 days.</p>",
  "pub_faq_4": "How often to clean a carpet",
  "pub_faq_4a": "<p>Households without pets or small children: once a year. With pets or small children: twice. Entrance runners and hallway carpets: three to four times.</p><p>For kindergartens, schools and care homes we recommend a three-month cycle, scheduled outside their working hours.</p>",
  "pub_about_eyebrow": "About us",
  "pub_about_title": "Thirty years in the field.",
  "pub_about_p1": "Chistify is a brand of DRAJ-K from Dugo Selo. For thirty years we've looked after residential buildings, offices, homes and outdoor and green areas in Dugo Selo, Zagreb and the surrounding area.",
  "pub_about_p2": "We wash carpets in our own 200 m² plant with a drying room, so the {0}-hour turnaround holds in winter and in the rain too.",
  "pub_about_p3": "Anyone can buy the equipment. What sets us apart is that every job has a written standard, a report and a photo.",
  "pub_about_img1": "Chistify team cleaning a flat",
  "pub_about_img2": "Stairwell maintenance",
  "pub_final_title": "Tell us what needs cleaning. You'll know the price up front.",
  "pub_final_text": "You pay only after the carpet is cleaned and returned.",
  "pub_final_call": "Call {0}",
